    "text": "The set of values of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>k</mi></math>&nbsp;for which the circle <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi><mo>:</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;lies inside the fourth quadrant and the point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;lies on or inside the circle <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi></math>&nbsp;is",
