  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given equation of circle&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi><mo>:</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mi>k</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Centre&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>;</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>13</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msqrt><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>13</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>case (i) Point&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;lies on or inside circle&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mfrac><mn>92</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8943;</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>case (ii)&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi></math>&nbsp;lies in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>4</mn><mi>th</mi></msup></math>&nbsp;quadrant</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/88e4e686-abef-419a-83a3-e364eaba269f-image.png\" style=\"width: 140px; height: 101px;\" /></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>r</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>13</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>k</mi></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8943;</mo><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Hence from equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>&#8745;</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>&#8745;</mo><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mn>92</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mo>]</mo></math></p>",
